#Grabber
Right Bumper - Open servo (direction?)
Left Bumper - Close servo (direction?)
Up D-Pad - Collection DC motor up
Down D-Pad - Collection DC motor down

#Sorting
Left D-Pad - Counter-Clockwise servo 90 degress (Trash hole)
Right D-Pad - Clockwise servo 90 degrees (Recycle hole)

#Drivetrain
Right Trigger - Pivot Right
Left Trigger - Pivot Left
Left Joystick - Movement figure out analog values for forward, backward, steering
